abstract: >
  Exploratory data analysis of personal finance expense transactions using Python, pandas, Matplotlib, and Jupyter. The project examines data quality, transaction amounts, expense category frequency, total spending by category, and unusually large transactions while applying a reproducible analytics workflow.

